{"startIndex":13755,"endIndex":14050,"textRun":{"content":"RAND Global Catastrophic Risk Assessment. Placement and size of the ovals in this figure represent a qualitative depiction of the relative relationships among threats and hazards. The figure presents only examples of cases or scenarios described in those chapters, not all scenarios described  (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":14050,"endIndex":14069,"textRun":{"content":"Willis et al., 2024","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://www.rand.org/pubs/research_reports/RRA2981-1.html"}}}},{"startIndex":14069,"endIndex":14072,"textRun":{"content":").\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}}],"tableRowStyle":{"minRowHeight":{"unit":"PT"}}}],"tableStyle":{"tableColumnProperties":[{"widthType":"FIXED_WIDTH","width":{"magnitude":80,"unit":"PT"}}]}}},{"startIndex":14073,"endIndex":14074,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":14073,"endIndex":14074,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"},"weightedFontFamily":{"fontFamily":"Book Antiqua","weight":400}}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"JUSTIFIED","lineSpacing":120.00001,"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":14074,"endIndex":14804,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":14074,"endIndex":14075,"textRun":{"content":"H","textStyle":{"bold":true}}},{"startIndex":14075,"endIndex":14156,"textRun":{"content":"igher-severity risks represent irreversible mistakes with permanent consequences.","textStyle":{"bold":true}}},{"startIndex":14156,"endIndex":14641,"textRun":{"content":" We already see AI causing documented harm to real people, and having destabilizing effects on global systems. However, catastrophic and existential risks present a fundamentally different challenge: if advanced AI systems cause existential catastrophe, humanity cannot learn from the mistake and implement better safeguards. This irreversibility leads some researchers to argue for prioritizing prevention of low-probability, high-impact scenarios alongside addressing current harms (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":14641,"endIndex":14654,"textRun":{"content":"Bostrom, 2002","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://nickbostrom.com/existential/risks"}}}},{"startIndex":14654,"endIndex":14757,"textRun":{"content":"). Though people disagree about the appropriate balance of attention across different risk severities (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":14757,"endIndex":14782,"textRun":{"content":"Oxford Union Debate, 2024","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOAFgXcJkZ2wFf3mcJ0xIFpJQgEDI274J"}}}},{"startIndex":14782,"endIndex":14784,"textRun":{"content":"; ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":14784,"endIndex":14801,"textRun":{"content":"Munk Debate, 2024","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=144uOfr4SYA"}}}},{"startIndex":14801,"endIndex":14802,"textRun":{"content":")","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":14802,"endIndex":14804,"textRun":{"content":".\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":14804,"endIndex":14805,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":14804,"endIndex":14805,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_