"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}},{"startIndex":171396,"endIndex":171810,"content":[{"startIndex":171397,"endIndex":171810,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":171397,"endIndex":171796,"textRun":{"content":"Bar Chart from a survey of desired AGI timelines. Participants were asked “Which best describes your position on when we should build AGI?” The participants had the following options: “We should never build AGI,” “Eventually, but not soon,” “Soon, but not as fast as possible,” “We should develop more powerful and more general systems as fast as possible.” Participants were split by their career (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":171796,"endIndex":171807,"textRun":{"content":"Field, 2025","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14870"}}}},{"startIndex":171807,"endIndex":171810,"textRun":{"content":").\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}}],"tableRowStyle":{"minRowHeight":{"unit":"PT"}}}],"tableStyle":{"tableColumnProperties":[{"widthType":"FIXED_WIDTH","width":{"magnitude":80,"unit":"PT"}}]}}},{"startIndex":171811,"endIndex":172085,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":171811,"endIndex":171892,"textRun":{"content":"Expert estimates vary dramatically, spanning nearly the entire probability range.","textStyle":{"bold":true}}},{"startIndex":171892,"endIndex":172056,"textRun":{"content":" A 2023 survey found AI researchers estimate a mean 14.4% extinction risk within 100 years, but individual estimates range from effectively zero to near certainty (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":172056,"endIndex":172069,"textRun":{"content":"PauseAI, 2025","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://pauseai.info/pdoom"}}}},{"startIndex":172069,"endIndex":172071,"textRun":{"content":"; ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":172071,"endIndex":172082,"textRun":{"content":"Field, 2025","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14870"}}}},{"startIndex":172082,"endIndex":172085,"textRun":{"content":"):\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spaceAbove":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}}}},{"startIndex":172085,"endIndex":172109,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172085,"endIndex":172109,"textRun":{"content":"Roman Yampolskiy: 99.9%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172109,"endIndex":172133,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172109,"endIndex":172133,"textRun":{"content":"Eliezer Yudkowsky: >95%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172133,"endIndex":172153,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172133,"endIndex":172153,"textRun":{"content":"Dan Hendrycks: >80%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172153,"endIndex":172174,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172153,"endIndex":172174,"textRun":{"content":"Paul Christiano: 46%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172174,"endIndex":172196,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172174,"endIndex":172196,"textRun":{"content":"Holden Karnofsky: 50%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172196,"endIndex":172215,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172196,"endIndex":172215,"textRun":{"content":"Yoshua Bengio: 20%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172215,"endIndex":172239,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172215,"endIndex":172239,"textRun":{"content":"Geoffrey Hinton: 10-20%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172239,"endIndex":172260,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172239,"endIndex":172260,"textRun":{"content":"Dario Amodei: 10-25%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172260,"endIndex":172278,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172260,"endIndex":172278,"textRun":{"content":"Elon Musk: 10-30%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172278,"endIndex":172298,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172278,"endIndex":172298,"textRun":{"content":"Vitalik Buterin: 10\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172298,"endIndex":172317,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172298,"endIndex":172317,"textRun":{"content":"Yann LeCun: <0.01%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172317,"endIndex":172337,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172317,"endIndex":172337,"textRun":{"content":"Marc Andreessen: 0%\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":18,"unit":"PT"},"indentStart":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"}},"bullet":{"listId":"kix.wz2zva175emw","textStyle":{}}}},{"startIndex":172337,"endIndex":173186,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":172337,"endIndex":172410,"textRun":{"content":"The wide variation in estimates highlights several important limitations.","textStyle":{"bold":true}}},{"startIndex":172410,"endIndex":173186,"textRun":{"content":" First, many experts don't specify timeframes, making comparisons difficult. Second, the definition of \"doom\" varies between existential catastrophe, human extinction, or permanent disempowerment. Third, estimates are highly sensitive to assumptions about AI development trajectories, alignment difficulty, and institutional responses.  While we cannot access any \"objective\" probability of AI doom, even subjective expert estimates serve as important inputs for prioritization and policy decisions. The substantial probability mass that knowledgeable experts place on catastrophic risks—including those who developed the AI systems creating these risks—suggests the risk scenarios described in this chapter deserve serious attention rather than dismissal as science fiction.\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spaceAbove":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}}}},{"startIndex":173186,"endIndex":173218,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173186,"endIndex":173218,"textRun":{"content":"Appendix: Forecasting Scenarios\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"headingId":"h.r4yembyl3j3h","namedStyleType":"HEADING_1","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spaceAbove":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}}}},{"startIndex":173218,"endIndex":173219,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173218,"endIndex":173219,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":173219,"endIndex":173430,"table":{"rows":2,"columns":2,"tableRows":[{"startIndex":173220,"endIndex":173248,"tableCells":[{"startIndex":173221,"endIndex":173227,"content":[{"startIndex":173222,"endIndex":173227,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173222,"endIndex":173227,"textRun":{"content":"type\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"START","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spacingMode":"COLLAPSE_LISTS","avoidWidowAndOrphan":false,"shading":{"backgroundColor":{}}}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}},{"startIndex":173227,"endIndex":173248,"content":[{"startIndex":173228,"endIndex":173248,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173228,"endIndex":173248,"textRun":{"content":"section-description\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"START","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spacingMode":"COLLAPSE_LISTS","avoidWidowAndOrphan":false,"shading":{"backgroundColor":{}}}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}}],"tableRowStyle":{"minRowHeight":{"unit":"PT"}}},{"startIndex":173248,"endIndex":173429,"tableCells":[{"startIndex":173249,"endIndex":173258,"content":[{"startIndex":173250,"endIndex":173258,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173250,"endIndex":173258,"textRun":{"content":"content\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"START","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spacingMode":"COLLAPSE_LISTS","avoidWidowAndOrphan":false,"shading":{"backgroundColor":{}}}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}},{"startIndex":173258,"endIndex":173429,"content":[{"startIndex":173259,"endIndex":173429,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173259,"endIndex":173429,"textRun":{"content":"Narrative forecasts and world building illustrate how current trends could lead to catastrophic or transformative futures driven by automation and competitive pressures.\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}}],"tableCellStyle":{"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":1,"backgroundColor":{},"paddingLeft":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingRight":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingTop":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"paddingBottom":{"magnitude":5,"unit":"PT"},"contentAlignment":"TOP"}}],"tableRowStyle":{"minRowHeight":{"unit":"PT"}}}],"tableStyle":{"tableColumnProperties":[{"widthType":"FIXED_WIDTH","width":{"magnitude":80,"unit":"PT"}}]}}},{"startIndex":173430,"endIndex":173431,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173430,"endIndex":173431,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"START","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spacingMode":"COLLAPSE_LISTS","shading":{"backgroundColor":{}}}}},{"startIndex":173431,"endIndex":173450,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173431,"endIndex":173450,"textRun":{"content":"The Production Web\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"headingId":"h.cmd209m5om1","namedStyleType":"HEADING_2","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":173450,"endIndex":173451,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173450,"endIndex":173451,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":173451,"endIndex":173532,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173451,"endIndex":173492,"textRun":{"content":"This is a story adapted from content by (","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":173492,"endIndex":173515,"textRun":{"content":"Critch and Russel, 2023","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.06924"}}}},{"startIndex":173515,"endIndex":173517,"textRun":{"content":"; ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":173517,"endIndex":173529,"textRun":{"content":"Critch, 2021","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://www.alignmentforum.org/posts/LpM3EAakwYdS6aRKf/what-multipolar-failure-looks-like-and-robust-agent-agnostic"}}}},{"startIndex":173529,"endIndex":173532,"textRun":{"content":").\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":173532,"endIndex":174341,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":173532,"endIndex":173705,"textRun":{"content":"The Production Web scenario shows how today's automation trends could accelerate into an economic system that operates without humans—and eventually against human interests.","textStyle":{"bold":true}}},{"startIndex":173705,"endIndex":174341,"textRun":{"content":" John Deere tractors already plant and harvest crops autonomously using GPS and computer vision. Amazon warehouses run on Kiva robots that move inventory faster than human workers ever could. Tesla's factories build cars with minimal human intervention. High-frequency trading algorithms execute millions of stock trades per second, far too fast for humans to monitor. These aren't experimental technologies—they're deployed because they're more efficient than human alternatives. The Production Web story asks: what happens when this automation slowly spreads everywhere over time and these systems start coordinating with each other.\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spaceAbove":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}}}},{"startIndex":174341,"endIndex":174661,"table":{"rows":4,"columns":2,"tableRows":[{"startIndex":174342,"endIndex":174357,"tableCells":[{"startIndex":174343,"endIndex":174349,"content":[{"startIndex":174344,"endIndex":174349,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":174344,"endIndex":174349,"textRun":{"content":"type\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"START","lineSpacing":115,"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","spacingMode":"COLLAPSE_LISTS","spaceAbove":{"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"unit":"PT"},"borderBetween":{"c